<title>SWEDEN: Skanska says Bjork CEO, Schorling chairman.</title>
<headline>Skanska says Bjork CEO, Schorling chairman.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish construction group Skanska said on Monday that Claes Bjork, head of Skanska in the U.S., was to be new chief executive.</p>
<p>He would replace Melker Schorling who is to become chairman, replacing Percy Barnevik, who is leaving the board.</p>
